#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0267-A expect=skipped domain=ADAE
#note "ADURU is not declared. The gate is load-bearing on THIS half: its Check is empty(ADURU) with a populated ADURN, which on an absent ADURU column would fire on both rows (absent = all-missing). Requirements.Variables.All [ADURU, ADURN] rejects the dataset instead - same dataset shape as the parent's skipped_no_aduru fixture, asserted for the sibling."
#library standard=adamig version=1-0
dataset ADAE
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col AEDECOD type=Char
col ADURN   type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | HEADACHE | 5
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1023 | NAUSEA   | 3
